2026-04-05 09:25:20.629 | 24908 (24908) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "# SEO Hardening Plan \u2014 Production Metadata Manifest\n\nThis plan implements Next.js 15 SEO best practices and structured data to ensure Arkan's discoverability and social fidelity.\n\n## 1. Global Metadata Expansion (layout.tsx)\n- **Standardization**: Define `metadataBase` for absolute asset resolution.\n- **Social Fidelity**: Add `openGraph` and `twitter` objects with premium preview images and descriptive manifests.\n- **Manifest**: Add `manifest: '/manifest.json'` for PWA and search engine discovery.\n\n## 2. Structural Intelligence (JSON-LD)\n- **Schema.org**: Implement `SoftwareApplication` JSON-LD in `src/app/page.tsx`.\n- **Feature Map**: Explicitly define AI features (RAG, Document Export, Writing Tools) within the structured data payload.\n\n## 3. Crawlability & Indexing (App Router)\n- **Dynamic Sitemap**: Create `src/app/sitemap.ts` mapping all public tool nodes and documentation paths.\n- **Robots Manifest**: Create `src/app/robots.ts` with explicit allow/disallow rules for the production workspace.\n\n## 4. Visual/UX Synchronization\n- Ensure meta descriptions match the \"Intelligence Suite\" professional tone established in the visual polish session.\n\n## Target Files\n- `src/app/layout.tsx`\n- `src/app/page.tsx`\n- `src/app/sitemap.ts` (New)\n- `src/app/robots.ts` (New)\n"}, "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_857a3ad79ba04c2581675b335eb0f388", "id": null, "provider_name": "google-vertex", "provider_details": {"thought_signature": "ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz"}, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
